{
 "brief": "Gaza's civil defence has recovered 20 bodies, including 8 children, from the rubble of a collapsed building known as \"Happiness Building\" (Amarat al-Saada), Shehab Wire reported. Spokesperson Mahmoud Basal said rescue teams continue searching for 15 missing people at the site.\n\nRescue operations face severe constraints due to a critical shortage of heavy machinery, Basal added, as crews work under difficult conditions to extract survivors and bodies from the debris.",
